WEBVTT

00:00:03.430 --> 00:00:04.690
Swords from mid-air?

00:00:04.690 --> 00:00:06.980
Run! That person...

00:00:07.470 --> 00:00:09.690
That woman is dangerous!

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:13.270
How are we supposed to run?

00:00:14.330 --> 00:00:17.740
Tell me your objective and 
how you infiltrated us.

00:00:18.070 --> 00:00:20.240
If you don't answer in three seconds,

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:22.450
I'll kill you, one by one.

00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:25.460
Three...

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:26.630
Two...

00:00:26.630 --> 00:00:27.580
One.

00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:28.750
First one.

00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:36.560
Huh?

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:37.220
Oh?

00:00:37.910 --> 00:00:39.180
What?

00:00:40.860 --> 00:00:42.680
What did you do, bastard?

00:00:47.090 --> 00:00:49.400
That's twelve.

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:52.890
A drop in the bucket compared 
to the total number, but...

00:00:54.050 --> 00:00:56.030
Thank you for their return.

00:02:26.140 --> 00:02:29.320
<b>Episode 3 
Your True Enemy</b>

00:02:26.600 --> 00:02:29.330
Huh? What's happening?

00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:31.350
Are you... No way.

00:02:31.830 --> 00:02:33.590
The Gate of Babylon...

00:02:33.980 --> 00:02:36.800
It contains countless 
Noble Phantasm originals,

00:02:36.800 --> 00:02:39.340
and launches its inexhaustible 
supply like arrows.

00:02:39.830 --> 00:02:42.470
That Noble Phantasm is a treasury itself.

00:02:42.790 --> 00:02:45.180
The world's oldest hero,

00:02:45.760 --> 00:02:47.330
Gilgamesh.

00:02:47.330 --> 00:02:51.500
How does using my Card feel, Angelica?

00:02:52.280 --> 00:02:54.520
I see. So you incarnated.

00:02:55.290 --> 00:02:57.630
You catch on quickly.

00:02:57.630 --> 00:03:01.240
Though I only incarnated halfway.

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:02.600
That makes sense.

00:03:02.600 --> 00:03:06.200
The reason some of my treasure disappeared 
is because it was divided between us.

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:07.290
Where's Miyu?

00:03:08.970 --> 00:03:11.510
I only want to know one thing right now.

00:03:11.510 --> 00:03:13.420
Tell me where Miyu is!

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:16.000
And what will you do then?

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:17.690
Miyu is

00:03:18.090 --> 00:03:19.840
in the center of the castle,

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:22.840
on the top floor of the highest tower!

00:03:22.840 --> 00:03:24.370
The central tower?

00:03:26.030 --> 00:03:27.400
Please!

00:03:27.810 --> 00:03:29.020
Help Miyu...

00:03:29.020 --> 00:03:29.770
<i>Gush.</i>

00:03:33.230 --> 00:03:34.410
Onii-san!

00:03:35.310 --> 00:03:38.350
Speaking out of turn will only shorten your life.

00:03:38.350 --> 00:03:40.530
But either way, it's meaningless.

00:03:41.020 --> 00:03:44.740
All of you are going to die here together.

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:50.490
Illya-san, when I give the signal, 
hide in the cloth and run.

00:03:50.490 --> 00:03:52.820
Huh? What about you?

00:03:52.820 --> 00:03:54.070
I told you, didn't I?

00:03:54.070 --> 00:03:58.000
My objective is that Card of me she's using.

00:03:58.350 --> 00:04:01.130
You two, go achieve your own goals.

00:04:01.130 --> 00:04:04.090
Please... Help Miyu.

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:06.050
Rescue Miyu!

00:04:06.050 --> 00:04:07.920
Now, go.

00:04:16.830 --> 00:04:17.940
A quake?

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:26.820
Where are we going?

00:04:27.190 --> 00:04:28.640
Where else?

00:04:28.640 --> 00:04:30.290
The tower where they're holding Miyu!

00:04:30.760 --> 00:04:34.160
But even if we can see it, 
we don't know how to get to it.

00:04:34.160 --> 00:04:35.380
Yeah...

00:04:35.380 --> 00:04:38.340
All right, we'll use that door!

00:04:42.360 --> 00:04:44.340
Got it!

00:04:46.920 --> 00:04:48.050
We're falling!

00:04:48.050 --> 00:04:50.470
Why?!

00:04:51.960 --> 00:04:53.850
Quite the splendid fall.

00:04:54.740 --> 00:04:56.100
Ow...

00:04:56.450 --> 00:05:01.570
There's no way the front door would 
actually lead into the castle.

00:05:01.570 --> 00:05:04.900
Don't underestimate how twisted we are.

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:07.110
Y-You're...

00:05:08.070 --> 00:05:12.480
Well, if it isn't the nitwit duo 
I just played with earlier!

00:05:12.480 --> 00:05:15.120
Do you remember my name?

00:05:15.380 --> 00:05:18.250
Beatrice Flowerchild...

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:20.660
Yes, I do!

00:05:20.660 --> 00:05:23.510
Beako's so happy you remembered!

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:26.470
That surprised me.

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:28.640
As a reward, here's...

00:05:31.610 --> 00:05:33.600
a present to die for.

00:05:34.070 --> 00:05:35.130
Tanaka-san!

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:39.400
That's odd...

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:43.730
Why is your torso still 
attached after taking that?

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:46.040
Tanaka-san!

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:50.740
Are you all right? Hang in there!

00:05:55.060 --> 00:05:59.290
My stomach is throb-throbby...

00:06:00.700 --> 00:06:03.550
Hey, do you know what those are?

00:06:04.980 --> 00:06:07.710
Our master is rather passionate about his work.

00:06:07.710 --> 00:06:11.470
He's gathered Mystic Codes and magic 
items from around the world.

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:16.730
He's racked up failures, trying to change them 
into Noble Phantasms or Holy Grails...

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:20.480
And before we knew it, 
we had this mountain of trash!

00:06:21.060 --> 00:06:21.920
What are you—

00:06:21.920 --> 00:06:25.210
Everything here is a failure to be something.

00:06:25.210 --> 00:06:27.860
It's the Ainsworth family's failed history.

00:06:28.220 --> 00:06:33.400
But after all that, we finally 
obtained a true Holy Grail.

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:36.950
So anyone who interferes

00:06:36.950 --> 00:06:40.250
will obviously get super-bloody murdered!

00:06:46.500 --> 00:06:48.730
Did you think you were a match for me?

00:06:50.340 --> 00:06:53.470
Most of your assets belong to me.

00:06:53.840 --> 00:06:56.160
This was the obvious outcome.

00:06:58.100 --> 00:07:00.230
It appears the two who ran were caught.

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:02.240
That was fast.

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:06.150
Why do you laugh?

00:07:06.470 --> 00:07:08.240
Of course I laugh...

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:11.470
I'm in the middle of something entertaining.

00:07:11.470 --> 00:07:14.880
At times like this, people laugh, 
get angry, and cry.

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:18.870
Isn't that what being human means?

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:24.710
Though, perhaps that is something 
you cannot understand?

00:07:26.540 --> 00:07:27.930
I see.

00:07:27.930 --> 00:07:30.220
You insult me, then.

00:07:30.220 --> 00:07:34.720
In that case, I shall answer 
your insult like a human.

00:07:41.540 --> 00:07:43.190
Right...

00:07:43.550 --> 00:07:44.980
Tanaka-san?

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:47.790
Where's Tanaka-san?

00:07:52.170 --> 00:07:53.710
You're awesome!

00:07:53.710 --> 00:07:56.050
Seriously, what's with you?

00:07:57.430 --> 00:08:00.910
No matter how much I play, 
not even an arm comes off.

00:08:02.220 --> 00:08:04.680
I bet I could play with you forever!

00:08:06.840 --> 00:08:08.240
T-Tanaka-san!

00:08:09.590 --> 00:08:10.590
Huh?

00:08:10.590 --> 00:08:13.180
I said that you come later.

00:08:17.180 --> 00:08:18.330
Sleep.

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:20.500
Illya-san...

00:08:21.540 --> 00:08:22.890
Tanaka-san?

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:27.860
My entire body is throb-throbby...

00:08:27.860 --> 00:08:31.960
Huh? You're not making sense. 
What language is that?

00:08:31.960 --> 00:08:34.360
I don't like this.

00:08:34.360 --> 00:08:36.540
I don't like it, Illya-san!

00:08:38.190 --> 00:08:39.580
Tanaka-san!

00:08:39.980 --> 00:08:41.240
Yes, yes.

00:08:41.240 --> 00:08:44.030
That's the reaction I was waiting for...

00:08:45.070 --> 00:08:47.610
Cry more for me!

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:56.800
Enough...

00:08:59.070 --> 00:09:01.340
Stop this!

00:09:01.340 --> 00:09:05.020
What can you do with that hunk of wood?!

00:09:10.670 --> 00:09:11.560
Huh?

00:09:31.310 --> 00:09:32.890
Illya-san!

00:09:32.890 --> 00:09:33.910
Ruby?

00:09:33.910 --> 00:09:35.370
You were in here?

00:09:35.370 --> 00:09:39.940
I believed in you! I knew you'd find me!

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:43.830
Huh? What's going on?

00:09:45.550 --> 00:09:47.650
There's someone I want to beat.

00:09:47.650 --> 00:09:50.150
Someone I must beat!

00:09:51.300 --> 00:09:54.660
Nice, nice, nice, nice!

00:09:54.660 --> 00:09:57.750
I thought bloomers over there 
was the only fun one,

00:09:57.750 --> 00:09:59.450
but you're pretty crazy yourself.

00:10:01.750 --> 00:10:03.330
I'll play with you!

00:10:09.340 --> 00:10:10.280
What?

00:10:10.850 --> 00:10:12.460
The chains are moving on their own?

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:18.090
You know, even I laugh and get angry.

00:10:20.560 --> 00:10:24.390
So stop using my friend without permission,

00:10:24.880 --> 00:10:25.890
you mongrel!

00:10:31.650 --> 00:10:33.190
<i>Schneiden!</i>

00:10:34.190 --> 00:10:37.010
Don't use such shabby attacks on me!

00:10:37.010 --> 00:10:39.450
Full power, fire!

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:41.540
I told you, that's shabby!

00:10:42.570 --> 00:10:44.380
My attacks aren't working!

00:10:44.380 --> 00:10:47.640
We're still undeniably lacking in firepower.

00:10:47.640 --> 00:10:49.310
If Sapphire-san were here...

00:10:49.310 --> 00:10:50.790
You mustn't, Illya-san.

00:10:51.250 --> 00:10:54.400
You don't know how many organs you injured,

00:10:54.400 --> 00:10:56.960
or how many of those wounds still remain.

00:10:56.960 --> 00:10:59.800
That was a last resort, only feasible that once!

00:11:00.050 --> 00:11:02.010
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:11:02.010 --> 00:11:04.260
Hey, this is boring.

00:11:04.260 --> 00:11:06.580
I wondered what you were capable of,

00:11:06.580 --> 00:11:09.180
but those shrimpy attacks were it?

00:11:09.620 --> 00:11:12.100
If you have nothing up your sleeve,

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:13.860
I'm going to break you.

00:11:15.740 --> 00:11:17.320
Illya-san...

00:11:19.030 --> 00:11:22.250
If I don't have enough firepower, 
then I'll just have to raise it!

00:11:22.250 --> 00:11:24.510
If you could do that, we wouldn't be in trouble!

00:11:26.180 --> 00:11:29.020
<i>The sensations from when Kuro showed me...</i>

00:11:29.020 --> 00:11:31.040
<i>I still remember those sensations.</i>

00:11:31.490 --> 00:11:32.290
<i>I can do it.</i>

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:33.650
<i>I think I can do it.</i>

00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:36.090
<i>No, I'm sure I can!</i>

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:37.340
Now, I

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:40.260
can use the Cards!

00:11:41.260 --> 00:11:42.890
<i>Install!</i>

00:11:58.080 --> 00:12:02.030
What? You had some, too?

00:12:05.330 --> 00:12:07.410
Tanaka-san, stay behind me!

00:12:09.980 --> 00:12:12.450
I'm about to blast this place away!

00:12:16.230 --> 00:12:17.610
You're totally crazy!

00:12:17.610 --> 00:12:19.380
Nothing beats it, right?

00:12:19.660 --> 00:12:22.550
Fighting between Card owners?

00:12:23.380 --> 00:12:24.800
<i>Install!</i>

00:12:28.970 --> 00:12:31.250
I will strike you down!

00:12:32.340 --> 00:12:33.990
Strike me down?

00:12:33.990 --> 00:12:35.400
Me?

00:12:36.040 --> 00:12:37.900
You're joking, right?!

00:12:41.490 --> 00:12:44.460
<i>Machia Hecatic Graea!</i>

00:12:45.400 --> 00:12:47.700
<i>Machia Hecatic Graea!</i>

00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:50.700
Blast them away, down to the 
dust that comprises them,

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:52.710
Mjölnir!

00:12:58.480 --> 00:13:00.260
This is bad, Illya-san.

00:13:00.260 --> 00:13:01.630
That hammer is...

00:13:02.350 --> 00:13:04.850
That's some impressive thaumaturgy,

00:13:04.850 --> 00:13:07.890
but that's all it is, right?

00:13:07.890 --> 00:13:11.330
It's the pinnacle of a pantheon!

00:13:13.800 --> 00:13:15.600
At this rate...

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:20.070
Tanaka-san!

00:13:35.350 --> 00:13:38.100
She's only a fake trying to be a replacement,

00:13:38.100 --> 00:13:41.040
but you went easy on her because she's me?

00:13:41.040 --> 00:13:43.210
Good grief, you're so inflexible.

00:13:44.230 --> 00:13:47.320
Don't get cocky just because you 
stole possession of the chains.

00:13:47.320 --> 00:13:48.840
That won't turn the tables.

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:50.270
Indeed, it's not enough.

00:13:50.270 --> 00:13:51.350
Bark more for me.

00:13:51.860 --> 00:13:54.990
Your assets and the scale of gates you deploy

00:13:54.990 --> 00:13:57.600
still pale compared to mine.

00:13:57.600 --> 00:13:59.520
Yeah, so?

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:02.900
All gates, open!

00:14:05.950 --> 00:14:07.110
What is this?

00:14:07.470 --> 00:14:10.000
Did you know this, Angelica?

00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:14.080
This country has a phrase, "wasted treasure."

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:18.670
It's almost sad how that phrase 
seems to be meant for you!

00:14:32.350 --> 00:14:34.060
My Mountain Felling Sword, huh?

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:38.890
It's hard to say that using it in such 
a small area is very elegant.

00:14:39.840 --> 00:14:43.360
Don't get full of yourself, brat.

00:14:43.360 --> 00:14:44.880
That doesn't suit you.

00:14:44.880 --> 00:14:47.240
Stop mimicking my expressions of anger.

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:50.410
Now, don't give up. Keep coming after me.

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:52.890
I still only have a few arms.

00:14:52.890 --> 00:14:57.040
Someone with a king's fortune shouldn't 
be losing to a foot soldier.

00:15:02.770 --> 00:15:04.210
I understand.

00:15:04.950 --> 00:15:07.460
Even if I possess the greatest Heroic Spirit,

00:15:07.460 --> 00:15:10.350
that is the worst match against you.

00:15:10.350 --> 00:15:12.370
You aren't very well trained.

00:15:12.370 --> 00:15:14.510
That isn't an attitude of surrender.

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:17.730
I told you not to underestimate, little king.

00:15:18.660 --> 00:15:19.940
You?

00:15:23.140 --> 00:15:25.070
The Ainsworths.

00:15:25.340 --> 00:15:27.450
Quite the boast.

00:15:27.450 --> 00:15:30.540
How many Cards have you made?

00:15:33.320 --> 00:15:35.340
She twisted the space around her?

00:15:35.340 --> 00:15:38.540
No, she randomly displaced 
the spatial connection.

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:39.400
Too slow.

00:15:39.400 --> 00:15:40.000
<i>Inclu—</i>

00:15:43.480 --> 00:15:44.380
What?

00:15:45.570 --> 00:15:47.150
This lightning...

00:15:48.630 --> 00:15:51.580
What, it comes out here?

00:15:51.580 --> 00:15:55.140
Our connections are as screwed up as ever...

00:15:55.140 --> 00:15:57.770
Well, whatever.

00:15:57.770 --> 00:16:00.900
I feel so good after unleashing one again!

00:16:00.900 --> 00:16:02.320
Tanaka-san!

00:16:03.730 --> 00:16:06.730
Tanaka-san, why were you so reckless?

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:09.640
My, my...

00:16:09.640 --> 00:16:12.150
Seems we lost, big time.

00:16:12.550 --> 00:16:14.110
What the hell?

00:16:14.110 --> 00:16:18.440
How are you alive after taking a god's 
strike capable of breaking atoms?

00:16:19.120 --> 00:16:22.330
There's no way something like 
that exists in this world.

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:25.080
What the hell are you?

00:16:26.050 --> 00:16:29.190
Damn... I totally want you now!

00:16:38.910 --> 00:16:39.870
Gil-kun?

00:16:39.870 --> 00:16:41.020
Sorry for being rough.

00:16:41.510 --> 00:16:43.600
That blast opened a big hole in the roof.

00:16:43.600 --> 00:16:45.100
Retreat through there for now.

00:16:45.100 --> 00:16:46.500
Retreat?

00:16:47.400 --> 00:16:51.530
You still plan to fight, with Tanaka-san like this?

00:16:52.050 --> 00:16:55.910
If you're the type who finds value 
in defeat, then I won't stop you.

00:16:58.400 --> 00:17:00.040
You won't escape.

00:17:00.730 --> 00:17:02.290
We will escape.

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:09.170
Who...

00:17:10.730 --> 00:17:14.480
This smoke will only distract them a little.

00:17:14.480 --> 00:17:16.200
In their atelier, we're at a disadvantage.

00:17:17.800 --> 00:17:19.450
<i>It's not a quake.</i>

00:17:20.070 --> 00:17:21.600
<i>An explosion?</i>

00:17:22.820 --> 00:17:24.340
<i>Fighting?</i>

00:17:25.060 --> 00:17:26.890
Anyway, we must get off their grounds!

00:17:26.890 --> 00:17:28.140
All right!

00:17:32.980 --> 00:17:35.240
<i>The tallest tower, in the center...</i>

00:17:35.640 --> 00:17:37.090
<i>Are you in there?</i>

00:17:39.010 --> 00:17:41.380
Illya...

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:44.380
<i>Miyu...</i>

00:17:46.100 --> 00:17:48.740
Why are you here?

00:17:52.120 --> 00:17:53.330
What are you doing?

00:17:53.330 --> 00:17:54.090
Hurry!

00:17:54.800 --> 00:17:56.170
Illya-san...

00:18:09.400 --> 00:18:11.730
Illya-san, where's the cloth to hide us?

00:18:11.730 --> 00:18:14.360
Sorry... I dropped it.

00:18:14.760 --> 00:18:16.200
This looks bad.

00:18:16.200 --> 00:18:19.550
There's no cover for the next kilometer.

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:23.040
That's what this landscape is for!

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:25.200
You barbaric god!

00:18:28.980 --> 00:18:31.240
Get a clue already.

00:18:31.240 --> 00:18:32.880
You can't escape.

00:18:35.550 --> 00:18:37.930
Sorry about earlier.

00:18:37.930 --> 00:18:41.470
Since we were indoors, I shot 
one off without lightning...

00:18:47.420 --> 00:18:53.330
But this time, I'll make sure to break you!

00:18:53.940 --> 00:18:55.660
The power in her hammer is...

00:18:55.660 --> 00:18:58.160
No way. It's stronger?

00:18:58.820 --> 00:19:00.090
Huh?

00:19:00.090 --> 00:19:02.300
You're not firing back this time?

00:19:02.300 --> 00:19:05.280
Ruby, magical barrier and physical protection!

00:19:05.280 --> 00:19:06.220
Impossible!

00:19:06.220 --> 00:19:08.380
That hammer's power is on another level!

00:19:08.380 --> 00:19:09.840
We can't block it!

00:19:09.840 --> 00:19:10.960
Oh, no!

00:19:13.530 --> 00:19:16.880
At this rate, there'll be unilateral destruction...

00:19:17.280 --> 00:19:19.390
Blast away, Mjöl—

00:19:24.550 --> 00:19:25.950
What happened?

00:19:27.310 --> 00:19:28.140
Sniping.

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:29.730
Damn it!

00:19:31.970 --> 00:19:33.520
It's that Card.

00:19:34.290 --> 00:19:35.590
Again?

00:19:35.590 --> 00:19:39.240
I don't know who you are, 
you sneaky, pesky, trash Card,

00:19:39.240 --> 00:19:41.070
but I'll blast you away first!

00:19:42.700 --> 00:19:44.090
She's strengthening it more?!

00:19:44.090 --> 00:19:46.410
No way... How far can it go?

00:19:46.410 --> 00:19:48.820
Break—

00:19:48.820 --> 00:19:50.580
Stand down, Beatrice.

00:19:55.290 --> 00:19:56.290
Tsk.

00:19:58.720 --> 00:20:02.070
You shouldn't disturb a lady's homecoming.

00:20:04.900 --> 00:20:06.830
Where's this voice coming from?

00:20:06.830 --> 00:20:08.690
It's not sound.

00:20:08.690 --> 00:20:11.370
It's being magically projected from a distance.

00:20:12.140 --> 00:20:16.230
Listen carefully to this voice, Illya-san.

00:20:16.230 --> 00:20:17.290
That is...

00:20:17.290 --> 00:20:19.760
Forgive the delay in my introduction.

00:20:19.760 --> 00:20:24.890
I am Darius Ainsworth, 
head of the Ainsworth family.

00:20:25.450 --> 00:20:27.410
...your true enemy.

00:20:29.370 --> 00:20:31.620
My servants were rude to you.

00:20:32.050 --> 00:20:34.630
They meant no harm.

00:20:34.630 --> 00:20:36.300
Please forgive them.

00:20:37.840 --> 00:20:39.960
Let's break each other again.

00:20:40.550 --> 00:20:44.400
And now, farewell, Illyasviel.

00:20:48.680 --> 00:20:51.890
Let's go, Illya-san. Staying here won't...

00:20:52.450 --> 00:20:53.310
Hey...

00:20:57.030 --> 00:20:59.280
Even if I'm no match now,

00:21:00.190 --> 00:21:01.750
unable to reach you...

00:21:03.190 --> 00:21:06.950
Someday, I will rescue you.

00:21:08.300 --> 00:21:09.500
Miyu...

00:21:12.640 --> 00:21:15.600
Miyu isn't your tool!

00:22:59.690 --> 00:23:02.190
Looks like they managed to make it through.

00:23:02.550 --> 00:23:05.530
But they're headed toward the base, aren't they?

00:23:05.940 --> 00:23:08.530
What an idiot, storming it right away.

00:23:08.530 --> 00:23:12.740
However, that unexpectedness 
may be her strength.

00:23:12.740 --> 00:23:14.320
Who knows?

00:23:15.830 --> 00:23:20.030
Well, I suppose we should enjoy 
our reunion for now.

00:23:20.960 --> 00:23:35.960
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:21.550 --> 00:23:23.130
Enter Trance, Illya.

00:23:23.130 --> 00:23:24.880
I'll cut you to pieces.

00:23:24.880 --> 00:23:26.130
Why are you doing this?

00:23:26.130 --> 00:23:28.420
Quit taking advantage of others!

00:23:28.420 --> 00:23:30.810
I want to save Miyu, too!

00:23:30.810 --> 00:23:32.300
I promised I would!

00:23:32.300 --> 00:23:34.300
No, not yet.

00:23:32.820 --> 00:23:36.120
<b>For My Weak Little Sister</b>

00:23:34.300 --> 00:23:35.770
It's not over yet!
